            "review_title": "Review at King Bbq Buffet",
            "review_text": "synikster\nAlbuquerque, NM6 contributions\n0\nNot recommended. Bait and Switch\nJul 2019\nWhen you settle in for the buffet, which I choose the most expensive buffet. (don't bother with this as its not worth it nor any different from all the rest)\n\nThis is not mentioned on the menu, but they will bring out 6 dish of their choice and tell you its the most popular. No choice to decline and pick your own first. (which I hate squid etc). They brought out average to low quality cuts of meat. Lots of cheaper pork. Cheap seafood. Quality of one of the worse ive been to. \n\nSides at the bar are bland.\nPay extra for buffet for salmon? Worse quality ever. All fat.\n\nService? Slow. Rarely come back to help. They just want your money and feed you junk.\n\nGo elsewhere. Not here!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 16, 2019",
